WEBVTT

1
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:52.458
In verses 14.22 and 14.23

2
00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:53.833
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:56.000
answers Arjun’s questions.

4
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.875
He first describes the inner perspective
of such a person.

5
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.750
In these two verses He explains that

6
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:06.583
when a person is no longer disturbed by
the rises and falls of the gunas,

7
00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:10.458
only then should it be understood that
they are truly rising above them.

8
00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:12.250
This inner peace

9
00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.916
may not be immediately visible to others,

10
00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:16.666
but for the seeker within,

11
00:01:16.666 --> 00:01:19.375
it is the greatest sign

12
00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:21.541
of progress.

13
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Think about your personal life –

14
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.666
when your emotions

15
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:32.541
go up sometimes

16
00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:34.958
and down at others,

17
00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:38.750
do not think there is something wrong with you.

18
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.750
Prakriti’s three gunas –
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

19
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.708
always flow through the mind.

20
00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:49.875
But you are not that wave which rises and falls.

21
00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:51.750
You are the witness

22
00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.458
who watches that wave.

23
00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:58.333
When does true peace come?

24
00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:01.375
Not from controlling every emotion

25
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:05.000
or correcting every thought.

26
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:05.875
True peace

27
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:10.125
comes when you experience –

28
00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:13.375
‘I am not this passing feeling.

29
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:16.375
I am the stable witness

30
00:02:16.375 --> 00:02:20.625
soul that lies behind it.’

31
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:21.166
When the mind

32
00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:23.333
feels light and knowledge-filled,

33
00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:26.125
observe that state.

34
00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:29.166
When restlessness or sluggishness takes over,

35
00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:31.833
do not be alarmed.

36
00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:34.291
Simply observe that state too,

37
00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:37.000
without blaming yourself.

38
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.166
This practice

39
00:02:38.166 --> 00:02:42.000
gradually lifts you above the gunas.

40
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.083
Steadiness does not mean

41
00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:46.625
becoming insensitive.

42
00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:48.333
It means learning

43
00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:49.708
to respond

44
00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:51.000
with awareness,

45
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.333
not react out of habit.

46
00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:58.250
When you sit in this awareness,
you understand –

47
00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.541
your peace does not depend

48
00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:02.791
on the mind’s ups and downs.

49
00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:04.916
It arises from the witness

50
00:03:04.916 --> 00:03:07.000
state within you,

51
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.000
from recognising your true nature.

52
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.500
Lord Krishna says –

53
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.916
when a person is not disturbed by
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

54
00:03:15.916 --> 00:03:18.250
any of the three gunas –

55
00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:21.000
they begin to rise above them.

56
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.916
Instead of reacting emotionally

57
00:03:22.916 --> 00:03:25.625
to inner changes,

58
00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:28.875
they become a neutral witness.

59
00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:32.250
Such a person does not desire sattva,

60
00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.291
does not resist rajas or tamas when they come,

61
00:03:35.291 --> 00:03:38.541
and lets them pass like clouds.

62
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:40.416
They understand that these gunas

63
00:03:40.416 --> 00:03:42.708
are activities of the mind,

64
00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:44.916
not of the soul.

65
00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:46.000
This realisation

66
00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.916
makes them stable and balanced.

67
00:03:48.916 --> 00:03:52.458
They sit as an unaffected witness.

68
00:03:52.458 --> 00:03:55.833
They know – it is the body and mind

69
00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:58.958
moving according to prakriti’s signals,

70
00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:00.375
not the soul.

71
00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:03.750
Even when negative thoughts or feelings arise,

72
00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.958
they do not blame themselves.

73
00:04:05.958 --> 00:04:08.041
Instead they learn from them

74
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:10.291
and balance the mind.

75
00:04:10.291 --> 00:04:12.791
This practice of watching thoughts

76
00:04:12.791 --> 00:04:16.541
without being swept by them

77
00:04:16.541 --> 00:04:20.791
becomes the foundation for going
beyond the gunas.

78
00:04:25.416 --> 00:04:26.208
Do you

79
00:04:26.208 --> 00:04:30.541
truly know what mental stability is?

80
00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:32.916
Listen –

81
00:04:32.916 --> 00:04:35.583
when your mind is sometimes joyful,

82
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:38.833
sometimes sad, do not be troubled.

83
00:04:38.833 --> 00:04:43.541
Understand - prakriti’s gunas – sattva, rajas,

84
00:04:43.541 --> 00:04:47.083
and tamas – always flow through the mind.

85
00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:50.666
But you are not that wave.

86
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:52.666
You are the witness

87
00:04:52.666 --> 00:04:56.125
who watches it rise and fall.

88
00:04:56.125 --> 00:04:59.416
True peace does not come from
controlling every emotion

89
00:04:59.416 --> 00:05:02.500
or correcting every thought.

90
00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:06.333
It comes when you understand –

91
00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:10.416
‘I am not this passing feeling.

92
00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:15.375
I am the neutral witness behind it.’

93
00:05:15.375 --> 00:05:17.458
When your mind is light

94
00:05:17.458 --> 00:05:18.333
and you are

95
00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:21.458
in a state of clear thinking –

96
00:05:21.458 --> 00:05:24.666
observe these feelings.

97
00:05:24.666 --> 00:05:27.958
When restlessness or sluggishness takes over,

98
00:05:27.958 --> 00:05:29.750
do not panic.

99
00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:33.916
Simply observe those feelings too.

100
00:05:33.916 --> 00:05:37.916
Do not blame yourself for them.

101
00:05:37.916 --> 00:05:39.000
This is how

102
00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.250
you begin to rise above the gunas.

103
00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:47.208
Stability does not mean becoming insensible.

104
00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:52.875
It means learning to respond with awareness,

105
00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:56.500
rather than reacting out of habit.

106
00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.541
When you stay in this awareness,

107
00:05:59.541 --> 00:06:01.416
you will see –

108
00:06:01.458 --> 00:06:07.416
your peace does not depend on the
state of your mind.

109
00:06:07.416 --> 00:06:09.166
It comes

110
00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:11.958
when you recognise –

111
00:06:11.958 --> 00:06:15.041
who you truly are.

112
00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:16.333
Reflect on this.

113
00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.791
Have you seen –

114
00:06:22.791 --> 00:06:25.291
how even a small thing at home

115
00:06:25.291 --> 00:06:28.791
can turn into an argument?

116
00:06:28.791 --> 00:06:32.250
Someone says something in irritation,

117
00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.416
another responds sharply right away,

118
00:06:35.416 --> 00:06:36.750
and within moments

119
00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.833
the whole atmosphere of the home changes.

120
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:41.000
But think –

121
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.625
are you truly

122
00:06:42.625 --> 00:06:45.125
reacting to that person,

123
00:06:45.125 --> 00:06:49.958
or to the guna active within them
at that moment?

124
00:06:49.958 --> 00:06:52.125
When a family member speaks

125
00:06:52.125 --> 00:06:54.250
from anger or laziness,

126
00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:55.708
understand –

127
00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:58.500
this is not their permanent nature.

128
00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:02.541
It is a wave of rajas or tamas

129
00:07:02.541 --> 00:07:04.416
passing through their mind at that time.

130
00:07:04.416 --> 00:07:07.625
If you also react immediately,

131
00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:11.333
you jump into the same fire.

132
00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:14.375
If even one person in the family learns

133
00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:17.416
to pause and respond,

134
00:07:17.416 --> 00:07:20.750
the entire atmosphere can change.

135
00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.458
Remember –

136
00:07:21.458 --> 00:07:23.041
this is not weakness.

137
00:07:23.041 --> 00:07:25.625
It is true wisdom.

138
00:07:25.625 --> 00:07:28.750
When you remain steady,

139
00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:32.916
your silence is far more powerful

140
00:07:32.916 --> 00:07:35.666
than words spoken in anger.

141
00:07:35.666 --> 00:07:39.541
Stay neutral. Do not judge.

142
00:07:39.541 --> 00:07:43.583
This is the power that brings
peace to the home –

143
00:07:43.583 --> 00:07:47.375
not by controlling others, but

144
00:07:47.375 --> 00:07:51.958
by remaining stable within yourself.
Reflect on this.

145
00:07:56.416 --> 00:07:57.500
Now think

146
00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.583
about your workplace.

147
00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:03.166
In today’s fast-paced world,

148
00:08:03.166 --> 00:08:05.375
pressure is constant –

149
00:08:05.375 --> 00:08:07.208
deadlines,

150
00:08:07.208 --> 00:08:08.750
shifting priorities,

151
00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.791
team challenges –

152
00:08:09.791 --> 00:08:13.250
all of these can shake you from within.

153
00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:16.625
But in the midst of this turbulence, your peace

154
00:08:16.625 --> 00:08:19.625
can become your greatest strength.

155
00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:20.916
Most people

156
00:08:20.916 --> 00:08:23.666
react according to whichever guna

157
00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:26.916
is dominating them at that moment.

158
00:08:26.916 --> 00:08:29.750
Rajas makes them restless,

159
00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.625
tamas makes them careless.

160
00:08:32.625 --> 00:08:36.125
But if you understand these gunas

161
00:08:36.125 --> 00:08:38.666
and rise above them,

162
00:08:38.666 --> 00:08:40.833
you gain clarity.

163
00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:44.250
Then in every situation you do not react –

164
00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.625
you respond with awareness.

165
00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:49.250
When people around you are anxious,

166
00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.416
your peace shows them the way.

167
00:08:52.416 --> 00:08:54.666
When situations fall apart,

168
00:08:54.666 --> 00:09:00.458
your equanimity rebuilds without
placing blame.

169
00:09:00.458 --> 00:09:02.166
This is not passivity –

170
00:09:02.166 --> 00:09:05.666
it is the steadiness born of awareness.

171
00:09:05.666 --> 00:09:09.166
When you work from this elevated level,

172
00:09:09.166 --> 00:09:12.333
your decisions are more effective

173
00:09:12.333 --> 00:09:14.333
and your presence generates

174
00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:16.583
more trust.

175
00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:21.541
So never underestimate your peace.

176
00:09:21.541 --> 00:09:24.291
It is not merely a skill –

177
00:09:24.291 --> 00:09:27.500
it is your true strength.

178
00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.750
The person who can remain

179
00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:33.041
balanced even amidst noise and pressure

180
00:09:33.041 --> 00:09:36.416
becomes the anchor for everyone

181
00:09:36.416 --> 00:09:39.416
in the most decisive moments.

182
00:09:39.416 --> 00:09:40.750
Reflect on this.
